   "stem_html": "Consider the example above. Given <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">leaf_count = 9</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">leaf_shape = \"teardrop\"</code>, what is the output?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328372,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Might be poison ivy</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "leaf_count == 3 is False, so the outer if branch is not taken regardless of leaf_shape's value."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328373,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Might be poison oak</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "leaf_count == 3 is False, so the outer if branch is not taken. The nested if-else statement is not executed."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328374,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Might be poison sumac</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
